Command name abbreviations are allowed if unambiguous.
Set automatic usage of hardware breakpoints.
If set, the debugger will automatically use hardware breakpoints for
breakpoints set with "break" but falling in read-only memory.  If not set,
a warning will be emitted for such breakpoints.
Set the maximum number of target hardware breakpoints.
Specify "unlimited" for unlimited hardware breakpoints.
The target architecture is set to "auto" (currently "arm").
